        "TileImage": "$($repository e3352213-fc25-4e38-9bed-d44d7dd09809).Image",
        "Description": "Why you do. 47.\r\rThis contract comes from an unexpected source. Elizabeth Lang, daughter of the late Dorian Lang. Or, as most would know him, The Red Robin. She has managed to gather information pointing toward these 3 men being responsible for carrying out the hit on Lang, Lee, and Maison all those years ago. She has decided that using their signature weapons against them would be a perfect turn of events. You know what to do, 47.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
